#: scenario:scenario_ED60E24A_D5D2_4199_9D4A_E94A9D9B3689
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 42233f7e7396df30fcaaf7c83731692c51ec5167b02d63d8f1bf32adcfa0617b
#. default-sha256: 83cbf1ed83652175e0294925e2b7192b564365253a8da9ead4f8f25f215d3fa8
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_ED60E24A_D5D2_4199_9D4A_E94A9D9B3689"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Master... ⟪k:7⟫What are your thoughts on the tale so far? ⟪k:8⟫"
"Which of the siblings do you think was in the right, Master—⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫the brother, or the sister?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫ねえ、⟪k:7⟫旦那さま……。⟪k:8⟫旦那さまだったら、⟪k:9⟫どう思います"
"か？⟪k:10⟫　正しいことを言っているのは、⟪k:11⟫兄なのでしょうか、⟪k:12⟫妹なのでしょうか。"

#: scenario:scenario_E474E618_8ACA_4FF1_83AD_08FF723BF1FA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e7a93ade6d914ef1331236034d27abb111d2c8242c96274ee753135ba5c22404
#. default-sha256: 97119be1aa964d23b68d3c94d3d603338ded140b4d734f8327cff358040bd108
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_E474E618_8ACA_4FF1_83AD_08FF723BF1FA"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Oh my. I apologize for the abrupt question. ⟪k:1⟫Did I startle you?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫まあ……急に話しかけてしまって、⟪k:1⟫ごめんなさい。⟪k:2⟫驚きました？"

#: scenario:scenario_8D2A83F4_D871_40E8_A3C0_7ECBEE106D84
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 49a70f0c4febb51d0a4896189824ac7be63f8c2756ee2decc3f5227280f032a3
#. default-sha256: b0c50c53ec1ca0a429c1c23dbbc1c2c6128c436a177e8298505f72e7ed9ddf38
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_8D2A83F4_D871_40E8_A3C0_7ECBEE106D84"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫What do I think? ⟪k:1⟫Hmm, yes, I believe Mell was probably right. ⟪k:2⟫He was also surely "
"happier than her."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫わたくしですか？⟪k:1⟫　そうですわね、⟪k:2⟫正しいのはきっと、⟪k:3⟫兄の方だと思いますわ。"
"⟪k:4⟫……幸せなのも、⟪k:5⟫兄の方。"

#: scenario:scenario_BD58283E_C541_4D18_BFD5_CEB565C496AD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6a40dfbf98ef475a1332591113344d2dd6dae4afd50152e1106c063a5cbc9257
#. default-sha256: fd95fe233e9c6dce97d9a3c2563f13e6a23544d0a776bcaddfd81f541089db1a
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_BD58283E_C541_4D18_BFD5_CEB565C496AD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫As Mell had anticipated, Nellie fled from the theatre, leaving her fiancé behind."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫ネリーはやはり、⟪k:1⟫婚約者の元には戻らず、⟪k:2⟫劇場から逃げるように飛び出しました。"

#: scenario:scenario_840EC02B_37B4_4C56_AB9D_93EC372AEA6B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1ac092f2af27d1c41823e378137b3d3132770fbdc65c360fce1837237c918b9c
#. default-sha256: 80c4740f65245e22d76f9b408e6a7b5aaeadf54457a83b96d5ac29757f0329f3
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_840EC02B_37B4_4C56_AB9D_93EC372AEA6B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She forced her way into a carriage stopped outside—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫probably one called for a "
"different nobleman—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫and ordered it to take her home."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫そして劇場の前に停まっている馬車を――⟪k:1⟫多分、⟪k:2⟫他の貴人のために呼びつけられたんでしょう"
"けど、⟪k:3⟫強引に使って家に戻ったのです。"

#: scenario:scenario_20148EFC_D4CA_43E2_83EE_685EC497B0EA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ea9dea3ceb2f0628a85beff4b47a5fbe573ff6040233e9b7e8ce161a23d58c72
#. default-sha256: 1bf626d7e1c14bd15e54083db5b4f11f95b1c828b91bf51b325f2a9391a1f472
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_20148EFC_D4CA_43E2_83EE_685EC497B0EA"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Mell’s assumption was correct: the only place she had to return to was the mansion."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫そう、⟪k:1⟫メルが思っていた通り、⟪k:2⟫彼女には家しか戻るところがないのですわ。⟪k:3⟫もう日は落"
"ち始めていました。"

#: scenario:scenario_626B90C5_EA2A_46FA_856B_08250A0C7389
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 97b8e227d6c8ec16aa5376e60593a16b049b7b4d50287fee5a7b7363c1211907
#. default-sha256: 62c02b535679f98ddaf018bc321786baee7d795c262533a38d613eb5e856211b
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_626B90C5_EA2A_46FA_856B_08250A0C7389"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The sun was beginning to set, and as a young lady, she could not simply go wandering through "
"town alone..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫彼女は女ですから、⟪k:1⟫気軽にどこかへ立ち寄ることも出来ませんし……"

#: scenario:scenario_0295D5D1_E317_4683_AD61_7F3D758B3BAC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a34cb43edd04d99f3d6fddcc6bf7e166b9a5467b673b0e24be6be636b631110d
#. default-sha256: 9f49da7f6833b466bb14dfdc8689c872dddfcb0e700ba5fd33d68ab39ff8b1ff
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_0295D5D1_E317_4683_AD61_7F3D758B3BAC"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫nor did she have any acquaintances to take her in."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫身を寄せられる知り合いも、⟪k:1⟫いませんでした。"

#: scenario:scenario_587C9FC8_1040_46EF_B47A_57D5413ACBDC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e7cb702b8c6b001e15590447d712abbe0c2cec9e44f9c843e88fb26d41d8ddfe
#. default-sha256: a4e3cf50a9679a45761c18bac4979c52d5871331ec70e709dfd272212cdcb698
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_587C9FC8_1040_46EF_B47A_57D5413ACBDC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Her world was, in essence, composed of two elements: her brother and the rose garden. ⟪k:1⟫"
"They were the light of her life at Rose Manor."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫彼女の世界は、⟪k:1⟫兄と、⟪k:2⟫薔薇の庭園、⟪k:3⟫その二つで構成されていたようなもの。⟪k:4⟫薔薇"
"の館の明るさ。⟪k:5⟫その象徴。"

#: scenario:scenario_2FC3DD34_E481_4494_960C_D3D731B5A50D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b41b13d2eed2363c254e475171be0a66ccb2994015c56ff3e96982e8c5ba99fc
#. default-sha256: 951fb13cd63af838614aee2691a3568fb5c1eecc980627e720d9d7de26ff5438
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_2FC3DD34_E481_4494_960C_D3D731B5A50D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫She lived a very... ⟪k:2⟫isolated existence."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫とても――⟪k:2⟫閉鎖的なものでしたわ。"

#: scenario:scenario_4DA89A01_3743_4A45_8132_C8AFB5DF153A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4cd34343d77b27496fa0fa8f472293a415e3fa16a1c7900d30440537e74d395e
#. default-sha256: 0ca854afbbd474ac50c2523724215d8d10d8841bbb61449599808fd0c7e9f5d9
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_4DA89A01_3743_4A45_8132_C8AFB5DF153A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫...⟪k:15⟫Haah... "
"⟪k:16⟫hahh!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫……ッ、⟪k:15⟫はあ……"
"はあ！"

#: scenario:scenario_E911BDA9_03B0_4029_B41B_9AD978B127BA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e0278f15c9735e266b9e87c52d1241be542b7195f5dfb1d7075dd056acae88f0
#. default-sha256: 35b3bc4ffff922be667e30cf3b363d4db1783530d1fd5763c2822dced26c4581
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_E911BDA9_03B0_4029_B41B_9AD978B127BA"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫N-⟪k:3⟫Nnh... ⟪k:4⟫nnnnh..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫う、⟪k:3⟫ううっ、⟪k:4⟫……う……。"

#: scenario:scenario_F8AB5E67_7037_4224_AB7C_700B0CAAA4CC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f848b37707f49075a1d9c9ea657364fa018c2db39e0535f90f795b7b2e19a2ff
#. default-sha256: 8e2062af64f6d71e5cff624633c5063e202224cbd803edc308480d7dde340d9d
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_F8AB5E67_7037_4224_AB7C_700B0CAAA4CC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫When she escaped back home, Nellie went straight to her room, locked the door, and "
"began sobbing."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫家に逃げ戻った彼女は、⟪k:2⟫自室に飛び込みました。⟪k:3⟫そして鍵を閉めて、⟪k:4⟫嗚咽を漏ら"
"し始めたのです。"

#: scenario:scenario_D0C668EF_842A_47D6_BE44_D88B4989EA41
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 05b8bbc48a0d8ea30989d08187452dc3f29831a083aa8380c6fc65978535678e
#. default-sha256: 9ed287018ff5728f8441bdcf2b658396d363cde796b0eb3af8c2ac69b8d607a3
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_D0C668EF_842A_47D6_BE44_D88B4989EA41"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The waves of her sorrow came crashing effortlessly over the levees."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫彼女の悲しみの大波は、⟪k:1⟫たやすく堤防を乗り越えました。"

#: scenario:scenario_C53DB2DA_FA3D_46A2_B1F5_2C04ACCAB047
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b64f979954101fd46a7a66be4fbed63826c31b5d58732c45a99cd262bfc5f819
#. default-sha256: f9446cb270f2dff2078fad771aa1b4b28f441fd651d10855ecc44f25bd20f29b
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_C53DB2DA_FA3D_46A2_B1F5_2C04ACCAB047"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Tears streamed through the cracked walls of the dams blocking her tear ducts."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫決壊した涙腺から涙が零れおちるのが、⟪k:1⟫いとも容易くて……。"

#: scenario:scenario_D1156FF3_8A4D_4CA6_B1E9_1CC2AA1D5D8D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6a7aeadff67dbf738997d8d08666534a6b3d4b4b71d7d6ab5d7237bddb77c695
#. default-sha256: 47c520d3406d917a92ce0d44290ec9ba38254eabc0c8cec9b4397cf87b78fd43
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_D1156FF3_8A4D_4CA6_B1E9_1CC2AA1D5D8D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Mnh, ⟪k:3⟫w-⟪k:4⟫waaaah...⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Why... ⟪k:7⟫whyyyy?!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫ふッ、⟪k:3⟫う……ううーっ……。⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫どうして……どうしてよぉ……！"

#: scenario:scenario_4FD5280C_D2E4_41C6_84F8_3EFF0F211A3B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 93ef73a3e391ca865aaa3581ced7fe5688edae0339fa509bb2fd6d89b1071874
#. default-sha256: 1123f4be7a658df67aa07dc5c4fbd855dc037ff67f1a79e5eac91dd943ceecca
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_4FD5280C_D2E4_41C6_84F8_3EFF0F211A3B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Why won’t you help me, Mell...?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Why won’t you take my side...?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫なんで……お兄さまは助けてくれないの……？⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫なんで……味方でいてくれないの……？"

#: scenario:scenario_CD837617_0249_467E_B012_5B7224AF6386
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ad4023c78e55623c80d8b08b21f688aafceb56fca7043c1d90e431ffa204c286
#. default-sha256: 28bada95bd39a91c1dc71b0c36446eaf956be958b77ceb7a02591b555f7fca2e
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_CD837617_0249_467E_B012_5B7224AF6386"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The decor in her room appeared blurry through her damp eyes. ⟪k:1⟫Memories of the day she "
"had it redecorated played back in her mind with crystal clarity."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫涙でぼやけた彼女の視界に、⟪k:1⟫部屋の内装が映りました。⟪k:2⟫記憶に鮮やかなのは、⟪k:3⟫模様替え"
"の日。"

#: scenario:scenario_431871F8_0EF3_4EB2_AC86_087BD5C0D022
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e524af2f8ee1d97baf665d26aa7ec2764842ccd2bc82932970363c6e12bf850e
#. default-sha256: 467f9dad6e381f83bf2f4476fba71cc1c2e3f42599f387197da2da0ef22ddf38
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_431871F8_0EF3_4EB2_AC86_087BD5C0D022"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫She told me... ⟪k:2⟫she had no feelings for you!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫お兄さまに……そんな気持ちは抱いてないって……言ったじゃない！"

#: scenario:scenario_7881CD7C_0E4C_4F4B_95F8_62EC1FBEBEE8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1c793456085df24bbfabfe526ac8875810b25c23d2dacb58c7fbdf7845ab8479
#. default-sha256: 27e60bd91358f1e50e4f537581ea12c99e13b9fef034a927fa12123fd1a5b0e8
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_7881CD7C_0E4C_4F4B_95F8_62EC1FBEBEE8"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫That liar!⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫That liar!⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫うそつき――、⟪k:2⟫うそつき！！⟪k:3⟫"

#: scenario:scenario_BE9D3E3A_EC16_4BC5_8528_3DAA68428BC5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c6e2697717d3ca6ae530c13c82f37e4e7120a31ec1b9f147cad4cd9a27b3f0eb
#. default-sha256: 6a7837b0ad75a051f3e4aa40e917b477b9fc936553a3cdb745f76ad6c70a44f7
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_BE9D3E3A_EC16_4BC5_8528_3DAA68428BC5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She let her emotions run wild, breaking glass craftworks, silver plates designed by famous "
"foreign artisans, flower vases, all sorts of things."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫彼女は衝動に任せて、⟪k:1⟫繊細な硝子工芸や、⟪k:2⟫他国からの有名な模様が描かれた銀皿、⟪k:3⟫それ"
"に花瓶――⟪k:4⟫様々なものを壊しましたわ。"

#: scenario:scenario_179DAB7F_3499_4FDB_B483_45B8EC775B27
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ce807148d075e1fe0d7b1fa52043f695f74f5b762f5df848af445102662c91b5
#. default-sha256: e5bb1ab6828aff69764821cda438200052c5faa6ff1ae18c2972dedd722c67d7
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_179DAB7F_3499_4FDB_B483_45B8EC775B27"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫It was as though a beast had been set loose in her bedchamber."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫それはもう、⟪k:1⟫気が狂ったようにひたすら。"

#: scenario:scenario_B812073A_9A8A_4DBD_8F0D_DE0CA1D9310D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b1d84c3b5f9b8b3f5360719d25f2f035d0407802d7e3a56283895a595419ae02
#. default-sha256: 37b77091eacc7624f06d77e2366eafe045bd954023afd6245177af747ce92098
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_B812073A_9A8A_4DBD_8F0D_DE0CA1D9310D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫—!⟪k:2⟫"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫―――ッ！⟪k:2⟫"

#: scenario:scenario_30ECB1CF_30F8_4DF3_B4AB_9E1A23286DDF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dffa3491902c988876bb97e41f45767d28605ba36a37a512ab8eef24b235c78e
#. default-sha256: 963d1b02ac6a6aaf2b970c7ee0e69eb76ff82c67dd9eccc08d311bbfa1adbb3b
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_30ECB1CF_30F8_4DF3_B4AB_9E1A23286DDF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The vase she tossed shattered against a painting hanging on the wall, spraying water, "
"porcelain, and roses in every direction."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫しかし、⟪k:1⟫彼女が薔薇の差されたままの花瓶を投げた時、⟪k:2⟫壁にかかっている絵にぶつかったの"
"です。"

#: scenario:scenario_84F082A5_A3E5_4E7E_8AC5_6484D5DC1230
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 14df79f39ce159ec432a69c0bb6218bb7cbb64ea6d4f4427774c9ae7e8159186
